{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 16, "text": "给华罗庚的信（一九六四年三月十八日）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n070)\n给华罗庚的信\n（一九六四年三月十八日）\n华罗庚先生：\n诗和信已经收读，壮志凌云，可喜可贺。肃此。敬颂教祺！\n毛泽东\n一九六四年三月十八日\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-5f2dca3947c7258c7065", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-070.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "8b936b186474e53a1ff117635eb50e4617f00a4f8ff73c29ec782652cfb8e3df", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "1eb9c948a31add2922735c985c2b0aa9bf1b575eb0cc5069962229d6d1552f9e", "text_chars": 141}
